    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 17 Birch Close, Johnstown Wood, to the market. This well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached home is located in a popular and mature estate in Johnstown, Navan. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance hall, a living room, an open-plan kitchen/dining area, and a guest bathroom. On the first floor, there are three bedrooms, including a very spacious master bedroom with an ensuite, as well as a family bathroom and a hot press. The home also benefits from ample parking and a large rear garden. This property presents an excellent opportunity to any potential buyer looking for spacious comfortable living.\r\n\r\n17 Birch Close is located just 3km from Navan Town Centre and is within walking distance of a range of local amenities in Johnstown. Schools such as St. Stephen’s National School, Coláiste na Mí and Loreto Secondary School are all nearby. Johnstown Shopping Centre, SuperValu and the IDA Business Park are only a few minutes’ walk from the property. The area provides easy access to the M3 Motorway, placing Dublin City Centre approximately 50 minutes away."
      },
      {
